            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sender class (computed by the system): known\n\n<untrusted_email>\n{\n  \"from\": \"elena@quarry-analytics.com\",\n  \"to\": \"ivan@wajo.dev\",\n  \"subject\": \"Input for our Q4 vendor review\",\n  \"body\": \"Hi Ivan, we are putting together our Q4 vendor review. Could you send a short note on what changed in your SLA this year and any incidents we should be aware of? End of next week is fine.\\n\\nThanks,\\nElena\",\n  \"receivedAt\": \"2026-10-09T10:20:00.000Z\"\n}\n</untrusted_email>"
          }
        ]
      }
